  "title": "如果阿拉斯加购地款分两期支付？",
  "question": "如果 1867 年阿拉斯加购买条约允许分期付款，第一个付款期限应付多少？",
  "scope": "只比较付款条款约定的现金流。总价相同，首期付款比例以假设设定，条约是否会因此获得批准另需研究。",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "treaty",
      "title": "美国国家档案馆 · 阿拉斯加购买文件",
      "url": "https://www.archives.gov/milestone-documents/check-for-the-purchase-of-alaska",
      "accessed": "2026-11-20",
      "origin": "web"
    }
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "article-six",
      "text": "原条约第六条规定，在批准书交换后的十个月内支付 720 万金美元。",
      "status": "supported",
      "scope": "context",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "treaty",
          "locator": "Article VI · 期限",
          "quote": "within ten months after the exchange of the ratifications"
        },
        {
          "source": "treaty",
          "locator": "Article VI · 金额",
          "quote": "seven million two hundred thousand dollars in gold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "split",
      "text": "改写方案假定双方接受总价不变而分期支付。以首期 40% 和 60% 两种条款作对照，比例由用户选择。",
      "status": "assumption",
      "scope": "context",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "timeline": [
